  (text "8-bit ISA multi I/O card: floppy (82077AA), XT-IDE compatible IDE, 16C550 serial, bidirectional parallel, 28C256 option ROM.\nGlue logic in three ATF22V10C GALs (sources in gal/). Every block can be left unpopulated and switched off by DIP switch.\nDIP switches: ON = 1. Jumpers select IRQ, DMA and power. Nets shared between sheets are global labels."
    (at 30 165 0)
